OL,3,AAnthropic flags revenue surge to
OL,4,Ainvestors ahead of stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as some tech stocks, including
OL,7,Ffirms that make the chips and other
OL,8,Fhardware that power data centres, have
OL,9,Ffallen in recent days over concerns
OL,10,Fabout the hundreds of billions of
OL,11,Fdollars being spent on AI
OL,12,Finfrastructure.
OL,14,FAn Anthropic spokesperson declined to
OL,15,Fcomment.
